  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FIECR - Fostering Inter-Ethnic Cooperation and Reconciliation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Unterst&#xFC;tzung Interethnischer Kooperation und Vers&#xF6;hnung</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to foster inter-ethnic cooperation in Kosovo by opening up space for mutual trust-building interactions, creating opportunities to jointly identify/address common challenges, and collaborate for community solutions by 
increasing cooperation for development and active engagement in decision-making processes in divided communities in Kosovo, focused on Albanian and Serbian communities</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Ziel ist es, inter-ethnische Kooperation im Kosovo zwischen albanischen und serbischen Gemeinden/Gemeinschaften zu f&#xF6;rdern, indem Vertrauensbildung, Kooperation und Probleml&#xF6;sung in den Bereichen b&#xFC;rgerschaftliches Engagement und wirtschaftliche Entwicklung vorangetrieben werden.</narrative>
  </description>
